{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install TanStack Charts and its Preact peer:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/charts preact","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"import { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/preact'\n\nexport function RevenueChart() {\n  const definition = useMemo(\n    () => defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n    [rows],\n  )\n\n  return (\n    <Chart\n      definition={definition}\n      ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n      aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n    />\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"},{"type":"text","value":" target the outer host. Preact owns that host; the\nshared runtime owns the SVG, measurement, interaction, and cleanup. The\nadapter emits the initial SVG during SSR and adopts it after mount."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"lifecycle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lifecycle"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component creates one shared adapter controller, prerenders its initial\nSVG, mounts it from a layout effect, forwards complete prop updates, and\ndestroys it on unmount. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Memoize the\ncomplete definition when it captures component values."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ssr-and-hydration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preact server rendering emits the complete "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-host"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-surface"},{"type":"text","value":", and accessible SVG. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialWidth"},{"type":"text","value":" controls responsive\nserver geometry. The generated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useId()"},{"type":"text","value":" prefix remains stable when the server\nand browser render the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"presentation-and-rendering","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Presentation and rendering"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style: JSX.CSSProperties"},{"type":"text","value":" apply to the outer host and are not\nforwarded to the chart surface. Custom styles are applied after adapter sizing.\nThe component starts with SVG and can compose marks that use\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"canvasChartRenderer"},{"type":"text","value":". Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderSvg"},{"type":"text","value":" to replace SVG serialization without\nreplacing the shared host."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exports: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartCommonProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPresentationProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartProps"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartTooltipBodyRenderContext"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPoint"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tooltip-body-composition","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tooltip body composition"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<Chart\n  definition={definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue\"\n  renderTooltipBody={({ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }) => (\n    <div>\n      {defaultBody}\n      <SeriesDetail points={points} />\n      {pinned ? <button onClick={dismiss}>Close</button> : null}\n    </div>\n  )}\n/>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The shared host owns focus, placement, portaling, and dismissal. Preact owns\nthe returned component lifecycle inside the stable tooltip body target."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./reference/chart.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":" reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"text","value":",\nand "},{"type":"link","href":"../../reference/chart-definitions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chart Definition API"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"lifecycle","text":"Lifecycle","level":2},{"id":"ssr-and-hydration","text":"SSR and hydration","level":2},{"id":"presentation-and-rendering","text":"Presentation and rendering","level":2},{"id":"tooltip-body-composition","text":"Tooltip body composition","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nInstall TanStack Charts and its Preact peer:\n\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts preact\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/preact'\n\nexport function RevenueChart() {\n  const definition = useMemo(\n    () => defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n    [rows],\n  )\n\n  return (\n    <Chart\n      definition={definition}\n      ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n      aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n`className` and `style` target the outer host. Preact owns that host; the\nshared runtime owns the SVG, measurement, interaction, and cleanup. The\nadapter emits the initial SVG during SSR and adopts it after mount.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component creates one shared adapter controller, prerenders its initial\nSVG, mounts it from a layout effect, forwards complete prop updates, and\ndestroys it on unmount. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Memoize the\ncomplete definition when it captures component values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nPreact server rendering emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`,\n`.ts-chart-surface`, and accessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive\nserver geometry. The generated `useId()` prefix remains stable when the server\nand browser render the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`className` and `style: JSX.CSSProperties` apply to the outer host and are not\nforwarded to the chart surface. Custom styles are applied after adapter sizing.\nThe component starts with SVG and can compose marks that use\n`canvasChartRenderer`. Use `renderSvg` to replace SVG serialization without\nreplacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodyRenderContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\n```tsx\n<Chart\n  definition={definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue\"\n  renderTooltipBody={({ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }) => (\n    <div>\n      {defaultBody}\n      <SeriesDetail points={points} />\n      {pinned ? <button onClick={dismiss}>Close</button> : null}\n    </div>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\nThe shared host owns focus, placement, portaling, and dismissal. Preact owns\nthe returned component lifecycle inside the stable tooltip body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Preact Adapter\ndescription: Render and hydrate TanStack Charts with Preact.\n---\n\nInstall TanStack Charts and its Preact peer:\n\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts preact\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\nimport { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\nimport { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/preact'\n\nexport function RevenueChart() {\n  const definition = useMemo(\n    () => defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n    [rows],\n  )\n\n  return (\n    <Chart\n      definition={definition}\n      ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n      aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n`className` and `style` target the outer host. Preact owns that host; the\nshared runtime owns the SVG, measurement, interaction, and cleanup. The\nadapter emits the initial SVG during SSR and adopts it after mount.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component creates one shared adapter controller, prerenders its initial\nSVG, mounts it from a layout effect, forwards complete prop updates, and\ndestroys it on unmount. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Memoize the\ncomplete definition when it captures component values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nPreact server rendering emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`,\n`.ts-chart-surface`, and accessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive\nserver geometry. The generated `useId()` prefix remains stable when the server\nand browser render the same tree. Keep definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`className` and `style: JSX.CSSProperties` apply to the outer host and are not\nforwarded to the chart surface. Custom styles are applied after adapter sizing.\nThe component starts with SVG and can compose marks that use\n`canvasChartRenderer`. Use `renderSvg` to replace SVG serialization without\nreplacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodyRenderContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\n```tsx\n<Chart\n  definition={definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue\"\n  renderTooltipBody={({ points, defaultBody, pinned, dismiss }) => (\n    <div>\n      {defaultBody}\n      <SeriesDetail points={points} />\n      {pinned ? <button onClick={dismiss}>Close</button> : null}\n    </div>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\nThe shared host owns focus, placement, portaling, and dismissal. Preact owns\nthe returned component lifecycle inside the stable tooltip body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n"}
